   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Greeting By Billy**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **Think Of What You've Done**: back after 110 archived shows (840 days); rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Fiddlin' Around**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- ***Seven Weeks In Country**: rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **It Ain't Before**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **#Wilted Flowers**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Dark Hollow**: rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n- **Someday You'll Call My Name**: back after 102 archived shows (775 days); rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2026-04-03** (recommended): source not stated; 28 songs; 153 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2026-04-03**: taped by Z-Man; transferred by Z-Man; source: Schoeps CCM4'S>Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II (48/32) [1]. Also: Recorded by Z-Man with K-Mac assisting, using Schoeps CCM4 microphones into a Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II at 48kHz/32-bit; Taped in Section 102 behind Row K, at 7.5 feet high; processed in Sound Forge, CD Wave, then FLAC 16-bit; Labeled show number 90 of 2026, a Team Dirty South and Home Team Recording, seeded by Z-Man [1]",
